<title>POLAND: Polish c.bank rejects all reverse repo bids.</title>
<headline>Polish c.bank rejects all reverse repo bids.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland rejected all 30 million zlotys worth of 14-day reverse repo bids at its 200 million zloty auction.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
